# Eval run records. One file per run, timestamped, and the model's wording moves
# between runs — tracking them would be churn with no reviewable diff. The
# fixtures they score (evals/fixtures/) ARE tracked, because a moving input
# makes two runs incomparable, which is the whole point of freezing them.
evals/results/
